& [RollbackCommission]
  + define cantor-succeeding-sop-fixture-rollback-commission/0.1
  + commission binds a distinct commission identity fixture root recovery owner B2B1 receipt supplied trigger failed successor snapshot restored snapshot one through thirty-two unique evidence identities fixture_only true live_activation_allowed false cleanup_authorized false and a separate domain digest
  + supported P0 trigger is boot_validation_failed only; operator_abort health_check_failed and startup_timeout remain planned but unexecuted until separately evidenced
