& [PreservedPredecessor]
  + reopen the rollback source path from the exact B2A rollback plan without following links or reparses
  + bound raw bytes by local addressability and require exact rollback revision digest and source-path correspondence with the B2A predecessor current_registry snapshot
  + never delete modify move rename normalize or rewrite the failed candidate or predecessor source
